data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":76,"item_id":"rs_086c410c8a1142a8016ac94282270c81948a212921055001e4","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Evaluating test migration**\n\nI need to consider the migration of tests to ensure they're robust. It seems important to add a comprehensive single test using the DatabaseSync fixture, especially with the old and legacy tasks. I should also check that the existing tests pass. This approach should help maintain reliability throughout the migration process. Overall, thorough testing will be vital as I move forward with these tasks."}

